  "$description": "Strata design tokens — GENERATED from src/theme/generateTheme.ts (npm run tokens). A theme is six seeds; every color below is a compiled projection, never a source. Agents: retheme by writing seeds and regenerating — never by editing values here. Each token carries its ledger decision under $extensions[\"strata.ledger\"]: a cut token is emitted as its fallback and should not be reached for.",
